[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149] STEP PURPOSE
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   step_149: Newtonian directional null (result b113).
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   step_063 showed that full planetary integrations reproduce the
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   catalogued orig->fut periapsis rotation per comet (rho = 0.999), and
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   step_042/063 regressed that rotation on a four-covariate encounter
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   budget (energy kick, closest approach, perihelion depth, inclination).
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   What has never been done is to apply the COMPLETE directional-analysis
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   pipeline -- the same battery the manuscript applies to the observed
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   discrepancy -- to the pure Newtonian rotation field itself.  This step
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   closes that gap.
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   For every channel v (per-comet scalar) the identical battery used on
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   the observed signal is run:
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T1  declared-cap contrast: Mann-Whitney (greater) inside vs outside
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   the 60-deg cap about the TNO axis (49,-17) and the declared comet
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   axis (34,-13); continuous Spearman vs theta.
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T2  shell morphology: median v in 0-30 / 30-45 / 45-60 / 60-75 deg
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   shells about the TNO axis (plateau vs gradient).
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T3  free sky scan on the 5-deg 2232-axis grid (the step_037 look-
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   elsewhere grid): best-contrast axis, its separation from the TNO
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   and comet axes, and the fraction of trial axes beating the
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   declared-axis p.
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T4  label-swap permutation null (20 000 draws): the cap median
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   contrast with directions fixed -- the step_037 B2 statistic.
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T5  axis-coincidence null: 2 000 full permutation sky scans (15-deg
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   coarse grid, MW z-score criterion).  For each direction-unlinked
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   realization the best-contrast axis is recovered and its
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   separation from the TNO axis recorded.  This prices the
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   coincidence that the rotation field's own best axis lands near
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   the independently derived resident axis.
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   Channels:
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   sim  drot_sim -- the pure standard-dynamics rotation (N-body model)
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   cat  drot_cat -- the catalogued rotation (observed)
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   res  drot_cat - drot_sim -- leftover after subtracting the full
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   conventional model (the review's decisive residual channel)
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   kick |daa_sim| -- modelled energy kick magnitude
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   rpk  drot_sim / |daa_sim| -- rotation per unit kick
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T6  arrival-geometry audit: in-cap fraction vs the cap solid-angle
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   fraction, median theta -- whether the arrival directions alone
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   predispose a cap result.  Separations are recomputed from the
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   arrival unit vectors against both declared axes (the b28 `theta`
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   column is the comet-axis separation and is not reused here).
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   T7  conventional-mediator audit: Spearman of theta against |daa_sim|,
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   denc and drot_sim -- which encounter property carries the
[2026-09-21 15:18:56 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 149]   directional structure under standard dynamics.
